-- kind: any
-- Clause 0 of every installed MUD law (p-templates finding 4: one law judges every verb). Reads and mutates
-- pass here (the grants and the game clauses decide); delegate / installPolicy / revoke only for the realm
-- founder. Verb tags: observe 1, mutate 2, delegate 3, installPolicy 4, revoke 5
-- (Compiler/CredentialAuthorityEntryCodec.lean:71-82).
any [ verb == 1, verb == 2, all [ verb in {3,4,5}, subject == {W_FOUNDER} ] ]
